From aed54425c3e8d9a02e50429140a3c8cc4558349a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Lemar Gonzales <johnlemargonzales@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:23:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Limit each account to 20 synced chats

A chat_session create or restore, or a chat_message into a missing or
deleted session, is rejected with reason chat_limit_reached once the
account has MAX_CHAT_SESSIONS_PER_ACCOUNT (20) live chats. Existing chats
keep taking messages and renames; deleting or purging frees room.
